{"version":1,"key":"card:18","content":{"id":18,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"如果一个值它是有限的几个值，我们一般会将该类型标记为枚举。比如服务返回一个字段 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"auth","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，它只有三种取值：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b3d65a8-4a3c-44e7-9e0c-756db239afbc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"0","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：只有管理员有权限","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"80425496-ad04-4d9f-a14a-4de9c9fd976f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"66f47deb-5f5d-4b66-89ca-974c08f4eb8b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"1","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：所有人都有权限","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ed0260c5-a3f4-4c4d-9b4b-6b7fde8bf3d4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7409950c-e5c0-4162-b48a-fd0d400cbdf4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"2","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：管理员以及部分成员有权限","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"21ec2027-3007-4eb0-972e-50694ec7d35c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8744d40d-c8db-47b7-bee9-d73b4c632b2a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"9e48ab31-e34a-43c6-99a6-a6ec0849664c","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"此时你可以声明一个枚举类型","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2ab0836e-209a-4186-9acc-71df2fb362ab","disableDrag":fa